message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below. The code is MIT; the OpenStreetMap-derived data in data/ are ODbL 1.0; CRTM data keep their own licence. See NOTICE.md."
type: software
title: "Madrid Transit Graph Explorer"
abstract: "Topological graph of the Metro de Madrid network built from OpenStreetMap with City2Graph 1.1.0 (v0.1.0 snapshot of 2026-11-19), with research studies on station and interchange disruptions. Structural and scheduled models only: not real-time, not demand, not observed resilience. Status of the v0.2-v0.5 studies: NEEDS_VALIDATION."
